OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor quits Tories on
OL,4,Afinely-balanced council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has quit the Conservative
OL,7,Fgroup on a finely-balanced council in
OL,8,FLeicestershire.
OL,10,FRussell Boam said he had left the Tory
OL,11,Fgroup on North West Leicestershire
OL,12,FDistrict Council on Tuesday.
OL,14,FThe Conservatives are part of an
OL,15,F18-strong alliance of Liberal Democrats
OL,16,Fand independents that runs the
OL,17,Fauthority.
OL,19,FBoam said he had made the decision
OL,20,Fbecause of concerns about the way the
OL,21,FConservative Party was being run in the
OL,22,Flocal area.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
